          "description": "Refresh the Ariadne index from inside the conversation. Call this when query_chains or expand_node returned a `stale_warning`, or after you know the user's code has changed. Re-scans every repo listed in the install-time ariadne.config.json, rebuilds TF-IDF token edges, and invalidates cached DB handles so the next query sees fresh data. No arguments; zero configuration.",
